{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261026%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 1500　3庭　上訴庭副庭長關淑馨、上訴庭法官周家明及陳健強<br/>大律師陳文慧社交媒體發言惹投訴　大律師公會裁違守則　陳不服提上訴｜宣布判決</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 1430　3庭　裁判官吳卓樺<br/>大班麵包西餅涉欠薪　董事廖志強被票控｜答辯</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>八旬翁涉損壞跑馬地墳場土地｜答辯<br/>► 0930　2庭　裁判官林子康<br/>27歲男子涉商場育嬰室強姦女子｜提訊日</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>涉行使假公安證及國家保密局公函　報稱港大博士生男子被控使用虛假文書｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>的士司機涉秀茂坪危駕撞斃八旬老婦｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.405999+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:51:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:10.168936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.538956+00:00","content_hash":"23887e2f709f8c0fc363b7065c5cd3c60409acad6b3f3ff333250b7630967c2e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}